{"id":"n41359-1-7","stage":1,"title":"낮잠 · 午睡","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41359-1-7-1","ko":"아침에 몸이 좋지 않다더니 지금은 괜찮아요?","zh":"听说你早上身体不舒服，现在好点了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침에","audio":"/audio/930cc492b37cd832fc24.mp3"}},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"좋지","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋지","audio":"/audio/93fe8dafc60040a28c9b.mp3"}},{"text":"않다더니","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않다더니","audio":"/audio/8751f56a317934fb80aa.mp3"}},{"text":"지금은","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금은","audio":"/audio/981101a536ceceb06592.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아요?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아요","audio":"/audio/db585874cabc5ce89a9a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/806accfc26fc32463c30.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41359-1-7-2","ko":"네. 두 시간 정도 낮잠을 잤더니 괜찮아졌어요.","zh":"嗯，小睡了两个小时左右，现在好多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"시간","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}},{"text":"정도","meaning":"左右","explanation":"정도：左右。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"3","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}},{"text":"낮잠을","meaning":"午睡，午觉，午休","explanation":"낮잠：午睡，午觉，午休；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"낮잠","audio":"/audio/2b5023cd196308d862ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41359","senseId":"1","lemma":"낮잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮잠을","audio":"/audio/8197df4b4b275ddd78b4.mp3"}},{"text":"잤더니","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤더니","audio":"/audio/6e07d08ea2e09cb4e8a0.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아졌어요.","meaning":"无恙，没事；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아졌어요","audio":"/audio/379d46e0739ca6f98d14.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"小时","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62842","definition":"时间单位。表示一天的二十四分之一时长。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"左右","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"那样的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"2b5023cd196308d8","term":"낮잠","zh":"午睡，午觉，午休","audio":"/audio/2b5023cd196308d862ae.mp3","entryId":"41359","definition":"白天睡的觉。","pronunciation":["낟짬"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b410b2a791814817ec0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.732,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41359","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.5587,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，小睡了两个小时左右，现在好多了。","听说你早上身体不舒服，现在好点了吗？","老师，您哪里不舒服吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你早上身体不舒服，现在好点了吗？","老师，您哪里不舒服吗？","嗯，小睡了两个小时左右，现在好多了。"],"answer":2}]}
